Rule 1 (input and other must be broadcastable)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, (if ndim(v_1) ≥ ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) else ndim(v_2)) - 1] : if ndim(v_1) - i - 1 < 0 then true else if ndim(v_2) - i - 1 < 0 then true else shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - i - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - i - 1)
