Rule 4 (out dtype matches inputs and is non-complex)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_3) = dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
